# isoloom targets
✗ cloud-vm (no cloud can run it (aws: machine `box`: arm64 on AWS comes later (Graviton instances and arm64 AMIs); azure: machine `box`: arm64 on Azure comes later (Arm-based sizes and arm64 images); gcp: machine `box`: arm64 on Google Cloud comes later (Arm-based machine types and arm64 images); digitalocean: machine `box`: arm64 on DigitalOcean comes later (it has no arm64 droplets); linode: machine `box`: arm64 on Linode comes later (it has no arm64 plans); oci: machine `box`: arm64 on Oracle Cloud comes later (Ampere shapes and arm64 images)))

# isoloom generate --target cloud-vm (exit 1)
· cloud-vm: no cloud can run it (aws: machine `box`: arm64 on AWS comes later (Graviton instances and arm64 AMIs); azure: machine `box`: arm64 on Azure comes later (Arm-based sizes and arm64 images); gcp: machine `box`: arm64 on Google Cloud comes later (Arm-based machine types and arm64 images); digitalocean: machine `box`: arm64 on DigitalOcean comes later (it has no arm64 droplets); linode: machine `box`: arm64 on Linode comes later (it has no arm64 plans); oci: machine `box`: arm64 on Oracle Cloud comes later (Ampere shapes and arm64 images))
